            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>&ldquo;Commercial License&rdquo;</strong> means a paid license agreement with Legesher Inc
              granting rights to use Hosted Services, Curated Datasets, or Curriculum beyond what these Terms allow
              without payment.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

