            <em>Curated Datasets and Curriculum are forward-looking offerings; at the time of this policy's last
            update, neither has launched publicly, and the rows below describe the licensing model that will apply
            when each becomes available. Hosted Services are covered by
            <a href="#hosted-services">Section 16</a>; a paid plan, where one is offered, comes with a plan-specific
            agreement presented at checkout.</em>
          </p>
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Activity</th>
                <th>Tier</th>
                <th>How to obtain</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Personal use of Hosted Services</td>
